  "steps": [
    "Peel the potatoes, cut into chunks and boil in salted water for about 15 minutes until very tender.",
    "Drain well and mash finely. While still hot, add the cornstarch and salt and knead into a smooth, slightly elastic dough.",
    "Flatten a portion in your hand, put a spoon of grated cheese in the middle, close it and shape into a thick square. Repeat.",
    "Fry in a little oil over medium heat for 3–4 minutes per side until golden.",
    "Add the sauce to the pan and cook 1 more minute, turning the mochi until glossy.",
    "Serve hot, with a square of nori on top if you like."
  ],
  "notes": "The caption's step list uses half the amounts (300 g potato, 60 g cornstarch). The ingredient list is for 6 mochi."
